**/node_modules
**/.cache
**/.turbo
# Prisma/zod-prisma-types generated output (regenerated by `bun run build`). Excluding
# these avoids a bug where the zod-prisma-types generator fails trying to recursively
# clean a *pre-existing* output directory ("Error while deleting old data in path ...:
# The property 'options.recursive' is no longer supported") -- it has no trouble creating
# these fresh when they don't already exist in the build context.
src/infrastructure/database/src/zod
src/infrastructure/database/src/prisma-client
.git
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/dist
**/test-results
**/storybook-static
**/*storybook.log
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.devcontainer
.vscode
.claude
